# Changes go through a worktree

Never edit, commit, or switch branches in the primary checkout
(`tools/primary_checkout.sh` — `~/live-poker-trainer` or `~/live_poker_trainer`).

For a new feature, bug fix, or any other requested code change, follow `.cursor/skills/make-change/SKILL.md` in this session.

While shipping, keep `docs/agents/` and AI-oriented comments current
(`.cursor/rules/agent-docs-maintenance.mdc`).

Do not launch a background subagent. Do not implement the change in the primary checkout.

Do not move the agent root into `.worktrees/<slug>`; stay on primary and use
`$WT` paths. A Cursor toast that `main` is already used by the primary
worktree is expected — dismiss and keep working (see the skill).
